    "trial_id": "PK08|0000320193-24-000123|extract|legal_proceedings_item3",
    "unit": null,
    "value_text": "Digital Markets Act Investigations On March 25, 2024, the Commission announced that it had opened two formal noncompliance investigations against the Company under the DMA."
